# Data and curriculum

Course content lives under `src/lib/data/`. Assembly hub: `courseData.js`.

## Assembly (`courseData.js`)

- `siteOverview` — marketing copy, study tracks, study loop, reading list
- `rawModules` / `rawLowLevelModules` — base HLD and LLD modules; merged with learning expansion modules before flow assembly
- `flowDefinitions` → `courseFlows`, `modules`, `allLessons`, indexes
- Helpers: `getFlowBySlug`, `getModuleBySlug`, `getLessonBySlug`, `getModuleProgress`, `getLessonPracticeSteps`, `getResumeLesson`

## Flow-specific sources

| File | Flow |
|------|------|
| `courseData.js` | HLD + LLD lessons |
| `hldLearningExpansion.js` | Standalone HLD learning expansion modules (`rawHldLearningModules`) |
| `lldLearningExpansion.js` | Standalone LLD learning expansion modules (`rawLldLearningModules`) |
| `dsaCourseData.js` | DSA modules; highlights from embedded/company JSON |
| `aiEngineerCourseData.js` | AI modules; lessons may include `exercises[]` |
| `dsaLearningExpansion.js` | DSA concept-lab expansion modules; hand-authored pedagogical lessons |
| `aiLearningExpansion.js` | AI/ML interactive expansion modules; Pyodide-safe NumPy/sklearn exercises |
| `questionBankCourseData.js` | Bank lessons with `questionBank: { key, label, kind }` |

## Modules by flow

- **HLD (11):** 9 base HLD modules plus systems-fundamentals-lab, reliability-observability-lab
- **LLD (6):** 4 base LLD modules plus lld-design-patterns-lab, lld-project-labs
- **Standalone HLD learning expansion (2):** systems-fundamentals-lab, reliability-observability-lab
- **Standalone LLD learning expansion (2):** lld-design-patterns-lab, lld-project-labs
- **DSA (5):** 4 base DSA modules plus dsa-concepts-lab
- **AI (10):** 8 base AI modules plus ml-interactive-lab, deep-learning-from-scratch
- **Question bank (4):** question-bank-top-sets, question-bank-faang, question-bank-more-companies, question-bank-strategy

## Lesson shape (typical)

`slug`, `title`, `summary`, `duration`, `whyItMatters`, `sections[]` (`heading`, `body`, `bullets?`, `codeExample?`), `checklist[]`, `pitfalls[]`, `interviewPrompts[]`, `diagram|null`, `related[]`. Optional: `likelyAnswerPoints`, `practiceMode`, `runtimeTarget`, `questionHighlights`, `questionBank`, `exercises`, `interactive`.

Ids: `{moduleSlug}/{lessonSlug}` via `normalizeModule()`.

## Deep knowledge (`lessonDeepKnowledge.js`)

- `getLessonDeepKnowledge(lessonId)` — curated deeper insights + external references per lesson
- Flow-specific source files under `deepKnowledge/` (`hldDeepKnowledge.js`, `lldDsaDeepKnowledge.js`, `aiDeepKnowledge.js`, `learningExpansionDeepKnowledge.js`, `questionBankDeepKnowledge.js`)
- Each entry: `insights[]` (`heading`, `body`) and `references[]` (`title`, `url`, `source`, `note`)
- Loaded in lesson route (`+page.js`) and rendered in the lesson page **Deep dive** section

## Banks and extras

- Question JSON (lazy in `QuestionBankIDE`): `top-interview-questions-*.json`, company files, strategy files — normalized by `src/lib/dsa/questionBank.js`
- DSA also pulls `all-companies-questions.json`, `leetcode-companies.json`
- Expansion sources: `rawDsaLearningModules` and `rawAiLearningModules` are standalone exports for future flow assembly.
- `interactiveLessons.js` — authored topic labs (`getInteractiveLesson`)
- `simulationLessons.js` — authored + generated HLD sims (`getSimulationLesson`)
- `lessonEnhancements.js` + `solutionLoader.js` — rich solutions for 9 case studies
- Diagrams: `/primer-images/*` under `static/` (asserted in `tests/courseData.test.js`)
